# Deployment artifacts, not source — regenerated from AMO's / your own signing output each release.
updates/firefox/*.xpi
updates/firefox/updates.json
updates/chrome/*.crx
updates/chrome/updates.xml

# The Chrome signing key — losing this is fine (generate a new one), leaking it is not: anyone
# with it can sign updates Chrome will trust as this extension. Never commit it, anywhere.
*.pem

# Config lives in the project root's .env (see ../.env.example) — nothing here reads a
# self-hosting/.env, but ignore one defensively in case a habit from elsewhere creates one.
.env